				{
					"id": 710210101,
					"content": "",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710210102,
						710210106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨利莫頓"
				},
				{
					"id": 710210102,
					"content": "用風之翼吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710210103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710210103,
					"content": "算了吧，我去了教令院之後，就一年到頭待在屋內，基本上不去室外活動。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710210104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨利莫頓"
				},
				{
					"id": 710210104,
					"content": "而且在教令院也基本用不上風之翼，我那些風之翼的操作已經全還給考官了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710210105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨利莫頓"
				},
				{
					"id": 710210105,
					"content": "要我用風之翼飛過去，飛一半我就要掉水裡…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "亨利莫頓"
				},
				{
					"id": 710210106,
					"content": "雇船吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710210107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710210107,
					"content": "我也這麼想，我記得荊夫港那裡可以雇到船，但是那裡也太遠了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710210108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨利莫頓"
				},
				{
					"id": 710210108,
					"content": "這一來一去也不知道要花多少時間…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710210109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨利莫頓"
				},
				{
					"id": 710210109,
					"content": "但是我總不能自己造一艘吧，這教令院裡也沒教過啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "亨利莫頓"
				}
			]
		}
	]
